This repository is a variant of plow-pbc/plow-hermes-agent, and the boot layer
it vendors -- the Dockerfile's structure, image/cont-init.d, and the s6-overlay
scaffolding around them -- comes from that project and from plow-pbc/plow-agents:

  Copyright Plow PBC, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The MIT grant above covers this repository's own work: image/seed (SOUL.md, the
prenatal skill and its scripts, config.yaml), image/crons, the luna-* scripts
and services, compose.yml, and the documentation. It does not relicense the
Apache-2.0 material above, which stays under its own terms.

Two things are fetched at build time rather than copied in, each pinned to a
commit and, where it is executed inside the agent, to a checksum:

  plow-pbc/hermes-plow-chat      the Plow Chat platform plugin
  plow-pbc/agent-index-client    the usage reporter (see vendor/client.pin)

The container image is built FROM nousresearch/hermes-agent, pinned by digest.
Hermes is NousResearch's, under its own license.
